```

This report can be a script output and does not need to be part of the PDF.

Use it to identify chapters where segmentation is still too coarse.

Inspect outliers and fix systematic causes.

## 19. Do not blindly split poetry

Be careful with embedded poems, couplets, chapter titles, inscriptions, and other non-prose material.

For ordinary prose:

```text
one `。` ≈ one verse
```

is the strong default.

For verse/poetry or unusual typography, preserve sensible literary units rather than mechanically producing nonsense.

Document any special segmentation rules in code comments.

